{"id":"632642","name":"果酱吐司","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/632642/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司","amount":"1块"}],"sub":[{"name":"迷迭香","amount":"1棵"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"半勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好吐司和果酱。","img":"images/632642/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"吐司分切两片。","img":"images/632642/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煎烤机刷油预热，放入吐司片。","img":"images/632642/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"上下盘加热2分钟。","img":"images/632642/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"其中一片用模具压出花型。","img":"images/632642/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"完整的一片涂抹果酱。","img":"images/632642/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盘子上铺上吸油纸。","img":"images/632642/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"两片吐司叠加码放盘中，把镂空的一片放到有果酱的上面，刚好露出草莓果酱。","img":"images/632642/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用迷迭香装饰。","img":"images/632642/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"即食。","img":"images/632642/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}